[en.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_MAGINO]
Mareginot Line

[en.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_MAGINO_desc]
To defend against the attack of the Starlight Rebels, we need to establish a line of defense along the long eastern border.

[en.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_MAGINO_TOOLTIP]
Build the §YMareginot Line§! on the §Yeastern border§!

[zh.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_MAGINO]
驹奇诺防线

[zh.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_MAGINO_desc]
为了防备星光叛军的进攻，我们有必要在漫长的东侧边境上建立一条防线。

[zh.FOCUS_C01_MILITARY_MAGINO_TOOLTIP]
在§Y东侧§!边境修建§Y驹奇诺防线§!

